{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC was created especially for those who love the world of <strong>Darkzan Adventure</strong> and want to <strong>support the developer</strong> directly. The main game is completely <strong>free</strong>, and this expansion exists as a way to <strong>thank everyone</strong> who believes in the project and wants to help it grow, evolve, and keep receiving new content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing the <strong>Supporter Pack</strong>, you\u2019re not just getting more content \u2014 you\u2019re <strong>supporting independent development</strong> and ensuring that new adventures can continue to be made.<br>From the bottom of my heart, <strong>thank you</strong> for believing, playing, and supporting. \ud83d\udc9b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Included Content:</strong><br>\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f 10 new playable heroes \u2014 expand your roster with unique characters and playstyles.<br>\ud83c\udf0d 5 new maps \u2014 explore brand new regions filled with challenges and secrets.<br>\ud83d\udc51 5 exclusive bosses \u2014 face powerful enemies created especially for this edition.<br>\u2694\ufe0f New enemies and random events \u2014 more variety, more surprises, more fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the game and want to be part of its growth, this DLC is the best way to show your support.<br><strong>Thank you for being part of this journey!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081400?t=1762170033","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081400/e5e1301341cb637f20a8ee648c92ae52a8270cdd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762170033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081400/74e593e27b8222ab6542cd9c787bc9d28cbc9021/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762170033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081400/74e593e2